---
{
  title: "pop"
}
---
### NAME

    pop() - Removes and returns the last element of the array.

### SYNOPSIS

    mixed pop( mixed ref *arr );

### DESCRIPTION

    Removes and returns the last element of the array.

### PARAMETERS

    arr  (mixed*)
         The array from which to pop an element.

### RETURN VALUES

    (mixed) The last element of the array.
